DESCRIPTION:Organizer: Field Museum - Events\\nCost: Included with admissi
 on\\nAges: All ages\\nCategory: Arts & Crafts\\n\\nVisit the Grainger Scie
 nce Hub to explore the technical traditions of Coast Salish weavers with E
 lspeth Geiger\, Curator Path Research Scientist\, Field Museum. Guests can
  expect hands-on demonstrations of traditional spinning techniques\, a cha
 nce to touch unexpected fibers\, and a look at the weaving craft of Coast 
 Salish artist Myrna Crossley. This session is part of our recognition of N
 ative American Heritage Month .\\n\\nMore info: https://www.fieldmuseum.or
 g/our-events/meet-a-scientist/northwest-coast-weaving-and-spinning
LOCATION:Field Museum\, 1400 S Lake Shore Dr\, Chicago\, IL 60605
